[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: User Requirements
UID: YAAP-UR
DATE: @GIT_COMMIT_DATETIME
PREFIX: UR-

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Introduction

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document defines the user requirements for Yet Another Audio Player (Yaap),
a time accurate desktop audio player.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Audio Playback

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Supported Audio Playback

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-001
TITLE: Supported Audio Formats
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to play audio tracks in supported audio formats.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-002
TITLE: Unsupported Audio Formats
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to identify audio files that Yaap cannot play.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-001

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Playing files

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-003
TITLE: Playing local files
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to play supported audio files stored on their device.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-004
TITLE: Cloud storage Connections
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to connect Yaap to supported cloud storage providers.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-005
TITLE: Playing Remote files
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to play supported audio files stored with a connected cloud
provider.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-006
TITLE: Audio Quality
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to play supported audio tracks at the quality provided 
by the source audio.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-004

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Audio Playback Position

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-007
TITLE: View Playback Position
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to view the current playback position of an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-008
TITLE: Seek Playback Position
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to seek to a requested position within an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-009
TITLE: Elapsed Playback Time
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to determine the elapsed playback time of an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-010
TITLE: Remaining Playback Time
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to determine the remaining playback time of an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-011
TITLE: Remaining Playback Time
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to access and submit playback information at the quality 
provided by the source audio.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-005

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Audio Playback Customization

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-012
TITLE: Playback Speed
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to adjust playback speed.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-013
TITLE: Playback Pitch
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to adjust playback pitch independently of playback speed.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-014
TITLE: Remaining Playback Time
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to adjust playback volume.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-015
TITLE: Remaining Playback Time
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to configure available audio processing options.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-016
TITLE: Remaining Playback Time
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to determine which playback customizations are 
currently active.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-006

[[/SECTION]]

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Organisation

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Audio Library

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-017
TITLE: Adding local files
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to add audio files stored on their devices to their library.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-018
TITLE: Adding Remote files
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to add audio files stored stored with a connected cloud
provider to their library.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-003
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-019
TITLE: Remove files
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to remove audio files from their library.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-020
TITLE: Accessing Files
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to locate, access and view audio files in their library.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-021
TITLE: Library Percistence
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to access their library across application sessions.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-007

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Searching, Sorting and Filtering

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-022
TITLE: Library Searching
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to search their library using tags or supported track
attributes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-023
TITLE: Library Sorting
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to sort library tracks using tags or supported track 
attributes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-024
TITLE: Library Filtering
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to filter library tracks using tags or supported track 
attributes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-025
TITLE: No Filter/Sorting Results
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to identify when a search or filter produces no matching 
results.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-008

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Track Metadata

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-026
TITLE: Viewing Track Metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to view the available metadata for an audio track. 
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-027
TITLE: Modifying Track Metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to modify the available metadata for an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-028
TITLE: Saving Track Metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to save metadata changes for an audio track.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-029
TITLE: Immutable Metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to identify metadata fields that cannot be modified.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-009

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Library Activity

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-030
TITLE: Viewing Library Activity
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to view information about relevant library activity.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-031
TITLE: Deleting Library Activity
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to delete information about library activity.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-010

[[/SECTION]]

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Queues, Playlists and Collections

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Playlist and Collection Management

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-032
TITLE: Playlist and Collection Creation
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to create playlists and collections of audio tracks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-033
TITLE: Adding to Playlists and Collections
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to add tracks to playlists and collections.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-034
TITLE: Removing form Playlists and Collections
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to remove tracks to playlists and collections.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-035
TITLE: Playlist Organisation
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to organise tracks inside of playlists and collections.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-036
TITLE: Playlist Metadata Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to metadata of playlists and collections.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-037
TITLE: Playlist Metadata Persistence
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to access their saved playlists and collections across 
application sessions.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-011

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Playback Queue

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-038
TITLE: View Playback Queue
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to view the current playback queue.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-039
TITLE: Add to Playback Queue
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to add tracks to the playback queue.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-040
TITLE: Remove from Playback Queue
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to remove tracks from the playback queue.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UR-041
TITLE: Playback Queue Modification
STATEMENT: The user shall be able to rearrange the contents of the playback queue.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: BR-012

